{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14212260","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14212260","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1421226001:0":{"text":"아, 날다람쥐가 멈췄어요. 길안내는 여기서 끝인가 봐요.","source_cn":"啊，小飞鼠停下了。它好像不继续带路了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FB63301773224E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1421226002:1":{"text":"저희가... 쫓아오길 바랐던 걸까요?","source_cn":"这是……想要我们追它？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA34435F9582DA49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1421226003:1":{"text":"아마도요! 페리엘 님은 날다람쥐는 숨바꼭질이나 달리기를 좋아한다고 하셨어요.","source_cn":"有可能！斐利尔大人曾说过，小飞鼠特别喜欢玩捉迷藏和赛跑...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9163BED61E983D3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1421226003":{"text":"아마도요! 페리엘 님은 날다람쥐는 숨바꼭질이나 달리기를 좋아한다고 하셨어요.","source_cn":"有可能！斐利尔大人曾说过，小飞鼠特别喜欢玩捉迷藏和赛跑的游戏。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9163BED61E983D3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421226004:1":{"text":"페리엘 님의 실험의 숲에 사는 날다람쥐니까요...","source_cn":"但这是斐利尔大人的实验林地中的小飞鼠……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90F4483D78923B77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421226005:1":{"text":"어, 어쩌면 페리엘 님이 준비해두신 걸지도 몰라요.","source_cn":"说、说不定这也是他安排的一部分？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x185FE6D53D910A77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421226006:1":{"text":"그럴 가능성이 있겠군요. 페리엘은 늘 예상을 벗어나곤 했으니까요.","source_cn":"确实可能，斐利尔确实总有些出人意料的点子.","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDF1ED10A1F2A308","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421226007:1":{"text":"두 분, 저는 날다람쥐와 놀아주고 싶어요! 페리엘 님이 의도하신 게 분명 있을 거예요.","source_cn":"两位大人，我觉得我们应该陪它玩！斐利尔大人的安排一定有...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB1B2DAD0B4D89427","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"두 분, 저는 날다람쥐와 놀아주고 싶어요! 페리엘 님이 의도하신 게 분명 있을 거예요.","female":"두 분, 저는 날다람쥐와 놀아주고 싶어요! 페리엘 님이 의도하신 게 분명 있을 거예요.","variant_male_record_index":"163338","variant_female_record_index":"163339","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1421226007":{"text":"두 분, 저는 날다람쥐와 놀아주고 싶어요! 페리엘 님이 의도하신 게 분명 있을 거예요.","source_cn":"两位大人，我觉得我们应该陪它玩！斐利尔大人的安排一定有他的用意。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB1B2DAD0B4D89427","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"두 분, 저는 날다람쥐와 놀아주고 싶어요! 페리엘 님이 의도하신 게 분명 있을 거예요.","female":"두 분, 저는 날다람쥐와 놀아주고 싶어요! 페리엘 님이 의도하신 게 분명 있을 거예요.","variant_male_record_index":"163338","variant_female_record_index":"163339","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1421226008:1":{"text":"네, 네! 저,